{"name":"Monarchist","hex":"#4b62d2","fetched":"2026-10-12","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"monarchist","whole":true,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["A supporter of, or believer in, monarchy."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/monarchist"}],"entries":[{"title":"Monarchism","blocks":[{"text":"Monarchism is the advocacy of the system of monarchy or monarchical rule. A monarchist is an individual who supports this form of government independently of any specific monarch, whereas one who supports a particular monarch is a royalist. Conversely, the opposition to monarchical rule is referred to as republicanism."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/6/64/World_Monarchies.svg/330px-World_Monarchies.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Monarchism","wikidata":"Q216669"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/a/ac/Shinz%C5%8D_Abe_at_the_Enthronement_Ceremony_of_Emperor_Naruhito.jpg/500px-Shinz%C5%8D_Abe_at_the_Enthronement_Ceremony_of_Emperor_Naruhito.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/a/ac/Shinz%C5%8D_Abe_at_the_Enthronement_Ceremony_of_Emperor_Naruhito.jpg/1280px-Shinz%C5%8D_Abe_at_the_Enthronement_Ceremony_of_Emperor_Naruhito.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/a/ac/Shinz%C5%8D_Abe_at_the_Enthronement_Ceremony_of_Emperor_Naruhito.jpg/500px-Shinz%C5%8D_Abe_at_the_Enthronement_Ceremony_of_Emperor_Naruhito.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"Enthronement ceremony of Emperor Naruhito in 2019","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AShinz%C5%8D_Abe_at_the_Enthronement_Ceremony_of_Emperor_Naruhito.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/b/b4/Louis-Philippe